      "text_preview": "However, as per the decision of the Hon'ble Supreme Court of India in Helen's Case referred supra,\nunless the benefits are exclusively for accidental death, the benefits given like family benefit, PF, life insurance, group insurance, house "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bba811a1ee0742caabd4ea9b539b1cdc_233",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Malini."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3f603383f8b642a3b549fc6a1217947a_235",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In so far as age of the deceased is concerned, the Petitioners have produced PAN Card and DL of the deceased as per Exs.P.10 and P.14."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b1200def47a64912bbc53a35d1681c62_236",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There is no contrary document placed by the Respondents."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0d8ea99cbaaa4dffa169ed9e235f1f6d_237",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, this tribunal has to rely upon this document."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "dc6729e2ff63402991d0c079be7eb297_238",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per these documents, the date of birth is 04.10.1971."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "961f38e35dda4f969a8bf848f35db9c8_239",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The accident occurred on 23.07.2020."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ef93e0258b7e4bb5bf6abc9d6043dd5e_240",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As such, as on the date of the  31 MVC No.2854 and 2855/2020  SCCH - 25 accident he was aged about 49 years."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "275dd21835fe4d2b874016ab2650c8f5_241",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, his age is considered 49 years."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2b5d22e71a064f8e936855009b3a4855_242",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n (i) LOSS OF DEPENDENCY AND FUTURE  PROSPECTS:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ca62202c12c946d7b3d98cc9d0b60d20_243",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The deceased was working in ALS Testing company as well as Trans Tools Corporation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f7b483b9c00a45d09190c2543c350ac1_244",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As already discussed,\nthe total annual income of the deceased comes to Rs.16,20,715/."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b077c4684f94463d8c421fcddfb5c138_247",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 23. As per the decision of Hon'ble Supreme Court in National Ins. Co. Ltd. Vs. Pranay Sethi & Ors (2017)\n16 SCC 680, in case of death of a person holding Temporary job, claimants are entitled for future prospects"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "da72f0c013ce4d02aeb25d99752bc8b9_249",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "G.S vs Royal Sun All Ins Co Ltd on 2 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/43199252/\n22  32 MVC No.2854 and 2855/2020  SCCH - 25 of 25% if his age is below 50 years."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ae0618deb140408c9a4f8631afb836e5_250",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This case is also relied upon by the counsel for petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e2771e79dd444b38a99fb4b971694756_252",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But in the present case, PW.3 who came on behalf of employer of the deceased has admitted that the deceased was working as a permanent employee in their company."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "559eb989457c44b68ff2a71cac37d948_256",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If an amount of Rs.4,05,179/ is added to the annual salary of the  33 MVC No.2854 and 2855/2020  SCCH - 25 deceased, then it comes to Rs.20,25,894/. In the present case the deceased has three dependents."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e92d9ea5834a43beb3d29aba3b628bc8_257",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per Sarla Verma's case, when there are two to three Dependants,\n1/3rd of his monthly income has to be deducted towards personal and living expenses."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "115edb384cbe4300ac1952c471bb6c25_258",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If 1/3 rd is deducted from the said amount it comes to Rs.13,50,596/."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d904876d19e848d2aaf579d8e3e49f8b_259",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the Malini.G.S vs Royal Sun All Ins Co Ltd on 2 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/43199252/\n23 total loss of dependency would be Rs.1,75,57,748/\n(Rs.13,50,596/ x 13 = Rs.1,75,57,748/).\n ii) TRANSPORTATION,"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "da39727d024c4199a439c5378c968de9_260",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In so far as the funeral and transportation expenses are concerned, the Petitioners have pleaded that they have spent Rs.1,00,000/ towards transportation of dead body,\nfuneral, obsequies and other incidental expenses."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9b34838a58834f1681d8699ecbbb2d79_261",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "No documents are produced in this regard."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7c72bbf82a114ebfaee8abf152e8b635_262",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, looking into the facts and circumstances of the case, it is difficulty to maintain bills for transportation of dead body and funeral expenses and hence it would be appropriate to  34 MVC No.2854 and 2855/2020  SCCH - 25 award compe"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9c450e671c324697aed733c4a346f36c_263",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n iii) LOSS OF CONSORTIUM:\n In Magma General Insurance company Limited Vs.\nNanuram (2018) 18 SCC 130, the Hon'ble Apex court has observed \"Consortium\" is a compendious term, which encompasses spousal consortium, parental consortium and fili"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e589fe0fb5264f5fb46f0bc439f6b377_264",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The right to consortium would include the company, care, help, comfort, guidance, solace and affection of the deceased, which is a loss to his family."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2f2c8e436384422688381b16e03b2e79_270",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This observation of the Hon'ble Supreme Court is reaffirmed in United Indian Insurance Company Ltd.\nVs. Satinder Kaur @ Satvinder Kaur and others, (2021)\n11 SCC 780.\n 35 MVC No.2854 and 2855/2020  SCCH - 25  25."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c1d114f70af7468991caa0cd33eccff4_274",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n iv) LOSS OF ESTATE:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ed2f3642269a42cea1c788efa654b8b0_279",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As such, in total, the Petitioners are entitled for a Malini."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "dca4bacfd7b64090acfd7428f95ffde6_283",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n LIABILITY  26."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "757156c0c9a042e6a67481d3412cab43_287",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "During the cross examination of PW.2 he has admitted that vehicles are not to be parked in Nice Road."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ab6562954869440c8176e076d4a1bd9c_288",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, the case of the petitioners is that they stopped their car due to tyre puncture."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1cded36ecb7845d989d4174ac3cdf3e6_289",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per Ex.P.4  37 MVC No.2854 and 2855/2020  SCCH - 25 the deceased and the petitioner in 2855/2020 were standing towards right side of the Car."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d126adece7664b96a327f207544b1009_290",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It was their responsibility to show their presence by placing some indicators."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e4340c0b37b04196b7d41304b49ed1db_291",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But the petitioners have not shown that they had placed stones or other indicators to show the stoppage of the vehicle and their presence."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e8ee0e3c2ac44079862988490913d5c2_292",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, this contention of the respondent No.1 needs to be considered and this Tribunal attributes 10% contributory negligence on the deceased."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "88bb6daeb71341639170b8e53e5fa729_293",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore if the same is deducted the respondents are liable to pay a sum of Rs.1,59,46,020/\n(Rs.1,77,17,800/  Rs.17,71,780/)."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b2d34d511206419eb3163948eaf9daee_294",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the Malini.G.S vs Royal Sun All Ins Co Ltd on 2 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/43199252/\n26 respondents being the owner and the insurer of the offending vehicle are jointly and severally liable to pay t"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e2863d4b8fcb4033ad4e2c95f6e14f3d_295",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Though the Petitioners have claimed compensation of Rs.4,00,00,000, Petitioners are entitled only for a sum of Rs.1,59,46,020/ with interest @ 6% per annum."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9df14cac4c1b414db4c0f48938e47dcc_298",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the petition needs to be allowed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ff1d66eef2c340169c5ddb9b4d630cb9_301",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In view of above answers to the above issues, this Tribunal proceeds to pass the following:\n ORDER"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5b7939afee2746e4bb04a6f2174952b2_302",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitions in MVC. No.2854/2020 & 2855/2020 are hereby allowed."
    },
